OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1789408554
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAHospital maternity unit reopening
OL,4,Adate delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Devon University Healthcare
OL,7,FNHS Foundation Trust, which runs the
OL,8,Fhospital, had provisionally planned to
OL,9,Freopen the services on 29 September.
OL,10,FBosses have now said the service would
OL,11,Fremain closed as they were not in a
OL,12,Fposition to reopen as anticipated.
OL,14,FThe trust has not set a new provisional
OL,15,Fopening date, but said it would
OL,16,Fcomplete another assessment on 28
OL,17,FSeptember and every two weeks after if
OL,18,Fneeded.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
